The residual confirms MPY cannot dynamically refine a symbolic `Val` into `Int` or `Float`, so the compare remains undefined to the prover. I’m applying the kit’s guarded dispatch pattern: a total `positiveNumeric` summary with disjoint Int/Float equations, plus a simplification twin guarded to exactly numeric values and the literal-zero comparison. I’ll also machine-check separate static Int and Float connection claims without that twin before treating it as sound.
